      <activity id="2703847a-dbac-5870-a5ad-b1a624264f4c" activityNameId="2b6ba4aa-d8b4-58bf-9524-e06b541f7838" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, liquefied, at liquefaction plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, liquefied, at liquefaction plant
The process is normalized on the gaseous form of gas. The net calorific value of natural gas is 36.0 MJ/Nm³. UUID=7623ff51-2645-3ae9-8b41-da2129d4ba64
This dataset describes the liquefaction of Russian natural gas in a Russian liquefaction plant.
Location: Global data for energy requirements combined and natural gas characteristics. 
Technology: Technology average.
Time period: Data on energy use for the liquefaction stems of a review of common technologies from 2019. Data on leakages stem from 1990.
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7623ff51-2645-3ae9-8b41-da2129d4ba64.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
